preConditionHook:
// EL: avgRange = average(h - l, rangeLookback), the window INCLUSIVE of
// the current bar as the source writes it. Average recomputes from scratch
// every bar (EL_Summation_Probe, 2,808/2,808) and h - l is a price
// expression with real history, so this is a fresh loop over price -- not the
// WFSafe_AvgTrueRange rolling accumulator and not a mirrored variable buffer.
// Summed newest-first, EL's Summation order.
avgRange = 0.0;
for (int i = 0; i < (int)rangeLookback; ++i) {
    avgRange += high[i] - low[i];
}
avgRange /= (int)rangeLookback;
